  <name>Lurkbox</name>
  <summary>A couch and controller client for Twitch</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.lurkbox">
    <name>Lurkbox contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      Lurkbox is a couch and controller client for Twitch, made for SteamOS Game Mode. Browse the channels you follow,
      watch live streams and videos, read and send chat, and do it all from a gamepad, a keyboard or the mouse.
      It runs as its own window, so Floater can float it over a game.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Following, categories, search and channel pages</li>
      <li>The player with chat beside or over the video, live rewind and clips</li>
      <li>Continue watching for videos you started</li>
      <li>An on-screen keyboard, themes and an adjustable interface scale</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      AI disclosure: Lurkbox is vibe-coded. Claude (Anthropic's AI coding assistant) wrote nearly all of the code,
      artwork and docs, and it was tested by hand. Human review of the code has been limited, so expect rough edges.
    </p>
    <p>Lurkbox is not affiliated with or endorsed by Twitch.</p>
  </description>
